## 0. Mandatory Code Standards

**FIRST INSTRUCTION**: Before writing any line of code, read and internalize
the rules in `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`. That file has **absolute precedence** over
any project-level configuration.

The rules in this file cover **project-specific additions**. The global file
is authoritative for everything else.

In case of conflict between this file and `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`,
`~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` always prevails.
If a rule in this file requires deviation from the global file,
request confirmation before proceeding.

